Package: seidlpal
Title: Colour-Blind-Safe Palettes and 'ggplot2' Scales
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Timo", "Seidl", email = "timo.seidl@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An eight-colour categorical palette checked for colour-vision
    deficiency, matching sequential and diverging scales with shared lightness
    steps, light tints for diagram fills, and 'ggplot2' scale functions.
URL: https://github.com/tseidl/seidlpal
BugReports: https://github.com/tseidl/seidlpal/issues
